---
description: Build or change Seekframe films (HTML animation films with params, cues, brand kit)
alwaysApply: false
globs: ["films/**", "examples/**", "templates/**", "brand/**"]
---
Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root and read `docs/FILM_SPEC.md` before writing or changing any film.
Key points: `seek(frame)` must be a pure function of the frame (no timers/Math.random/CSS animation); expose every editable thing as a manifest param;
declare sound as cues on the animation's frame numbers; run `seekframe validate`, `review` (LOOK at the contact sheets) and `sync` until clean; never weaken a check.
